  "text": "Solo Kalphite King\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis guide assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of Kalphite King, which can be found in #unknown-channel\n​\nBeing on a Kalphite slayer task  is recommended as you gain the benefits of the Slayer Helm  and Genocidal \n​\nThis guide assumes no Green Shields happen, you may opt to teleport out if one happens early into the fight.\n​\nPreset and Relics\n⬥ Necromancy \n​\n\nNotes\n⬥  Set the Autofire rate to 1\n⬥  Is only used if running \n⬥  Is only used if not running \n⬥   Skips Green/Dig/Charge\n⬥  Is used to despawn conjures after every kill\n⬥  Is used for better hit chance if not on task\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Can skip on task\n​\n Rotation\nPre-build:\nGet ~80% adrenaline → Enter portal\n +  East →  →  →  +  to instance + enter\n​\nIn the fight:\n →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → (tc) +  +  →  →  →  →  →  →  →   →   →  →  → Improvise\n​\n Rotation\nPre-build:\nGet ~80% adrenaline → Enter portal\n +  East →  →  →  +  to instance + enter\n​\nIn the fight:\n →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → (tc) +  +  →  →  →   →  →  →  →   →  →  →  → Improvise\n​\nExample Kills\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kills\n⬥ No Slayer Task\n⬥ Slayer Task\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Solo Kalphite King ​ Introduction This guide assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of Kalphite King, which can be found in #unknown-channel ​ Being on a Kalphite slayer task is recommended as you gain the benefits of the Slayer Helm and Genocidal ​ This guide assumes no Green Shields happen, you may opt to teleport out if one happens early into the fight. ​ Preset and Relics ⬥ Necromancy ​ Notes ⬥ Set the Autofire rate to 1 ⬥ Is only used if running ⬥ Is only used if not running ⬥ Skips Green/Dig/Charge ⬥ Is used to despawn conjures after every kill ⬥ Is used for better hit chance if not on task ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Can skip on task ​ Rotation Pre-build: Get ~80% adrenaline → Enter portal + East → → → + to instance + enter ​ In the fight: → → → → → → → → (tc) + + → → → → → → → → → → → Improvise ​ Rotation Pre-build: Get ~80% adrenaline → Enter portal + East → → → + to instance + enter ​ In the fight: → → → → → → → → (tc) + + → → → → → → → → → → → Improvise ​ Example Kills Example Kills ⬥ No Slayer Task ⬥ Slayer Task ​",
